1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,440
The spiritual path is not about being nice. I mean, nice is nice. If you can be nice,

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:09,620
you might as well be. If you can be harmonious and supportive, why not? But the spiritual path

3
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:14,480
is living authentically, according to the truth as you perceive it, and even more deeply,

4
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:20,160
according to divine guidance as it comes to you. And we have to have the courage to break the

5
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:27,300
rules. One of the profound limitations of the spiritual path is defined as too narrow a sense

6
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:34,580
of respectability. Just because society or other people have their ideas of how you ought to behave,

7
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:41,180
you can listen to them, you can take note of it, but deeply in the last moment you have to feel

8
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:48,080
within yourself what your own destiny is, what you are being guided to do, what your karma demands.

9
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:54,300
Truth always has more power than any other way of being, and that must be our standard.

